        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HRC253, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Handrail Bracket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty bracket used to support walkway and stair handrails. This handrail bracket is made from solid brass and is available in your choice of 8 finish colors. The large 2-5/16\" round wall mounting base offers very good support. Solid brass 1/2\" diameter rod that can support heavier loads. It has a 3\" projection off wall. Packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HRC253_size.gif?v=1704354705\" width=\"558\" height=\"230\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana HRC253 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana HRC253 Handrail Bracket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HRC253.pdf?v=1704262162\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana HRC253 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
